  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IUJGdLaw/images/c11eaf0acd61d4f66442179667a827a3d788d12e.png\" alt=\"繁花蔓延GUI横幅\">\n<p><strong>通过这个GUI大修，让你更接近实现田园诗般的梦想！</strong></p>\n<p>这个资源包将你的合成界面、盔甲栏、生命值、饥饿条、菜单等元素都装饰上藤蔓与花朵。<br>获得经验时看着花朵从地面生长，收集盔甲时收获花盆！</p>\n<p>作为《星露谷物语》\"繁花蔓延界面\"模组的粉丝，我希望能用Minecraft资源包复刻这种感觉，于是\"繁花蔓延GUI\"诞生了！</p>\n<p>从1.2版本开始，我们支持与不断增长的客户端模组和内容模组列表的兼容！</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f9NM0dXub\" rel=\"nofollow\">成就铭牌</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fEsAfCjCV\" rel=\"nofollow\">苹果皮</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" rel=\"nofollow\">背包扩展</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fjZJ9eGkD\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的铁砧</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fwQfMUdZT\" rel=\"nofollow\">彩色心之容器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fCNYyGWn5\" rel=\"nofollow\">压缩存储</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\">装饰盔甲重制</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fDMu0oBKf\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成调整</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fvvuO3ImH\" rel=\"nofollow\">饰品栏API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fIT6fZgjc\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态资源包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252ffRiHVvU7\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI物品管理器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fR2OftAxM\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fO7RBXm3n\" rel=\"nofollow\">库存配置升级版</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f5ibSyLAz\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品栏整理</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fP3iIrPH3\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多箱子</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fnvQzSEkH\" rel=\"nofollow\">玉</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fu6dRKJwZ\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI物品管理器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fkB56GtWA\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI职业扩展</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fuEfK2CXF\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI资源扩展</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f1DWmBJVA\" rel=\"nofollow\">葡萄园物语</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/CottonMC/LibGui\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibGui界面库</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fonSQdWhM\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibIPN库</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fbEpr0Arc\" rel=\"nofollow\">投影</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fGcWjdA9I\" rel=\"nofollow\">MaLiLib库</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fmOgUt4GM\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组菜单</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForged</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fqQyHxfxd\" rel=\"nofollow\">禁用聊天举报</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fnfn13YXA\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI物品管理器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fhvqcuDMT\" rel=\"nofollow\">RP重命名</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fz4LpKjxY\" rel=\"nofollow\">货运箱</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fRw1Ylmn4\" rel=\"nofollow\">星露谷钓鱼</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-belt\" rel=\"nofollow\">工具腰带</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fvRYk0bv7\" rel=\"nofollow\">垃圾桶</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f5aaWibi9\" rel=\"nofollow\">饰品</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fLOpKHB2A\" rel=\"nofollow\">传送石碑</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f1bokaNcj\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero的小地图</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fNcUtCpym\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero的世界地图</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f9sxDq6mj\" rel=\"nofollow\">巅峰属性</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>请注意，上述部分模组如MaLiLib和LibGui是多个开发者共用的库，任何依赖这些库的模组理论上都应被支持但未单独列出。<br>需注意如果更新中出现破坏性变更，依赖模组可能会失去支持。</p>\n</div>\n<p><br>想要更多繁花蔓延GUI？别忘了查看我们的现代化扩展包：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fextra-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">额外繁花GUI</a>！<br>如果只需要快捷栏美化，试试<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fovergrown-flowery-hotbar\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁花蔓延快捷栏</a>。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcoolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/coolbot100s/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252fua1AmdlB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f312747-d602-4561-bfff-d0102ea837ee\" alt=\"繁花蔓延GUI合集\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/generic-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持我们\"></a></div>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IUJGdLaw/images/252a451536a1b077ccb7e3dc8671c333fd911f47.png\" alt=\"快捷栏展示\"></div>",
